==English==

===Etymology===
non plus translates to no([[non]]) [[more]]([[plus]]).

===Verb===
'''non plus'''[[Category:English verbs that lack inflection template]]

# to confuse/perplex.

===Noun===
'''non plus'''[[Category:English nouns that lack inflection template]]

# a state of bewilderment.  a state where the mind can think no more.

